        "title": "The plans below show the ground floor of a library in 2001 and how it was redeveloped in 2009. Summarise the information by selecting and reporting the main features, and make comparisons where relevant.",
        "status": "draft",
        "content_writing": "<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><em><strong>The plans below show the ground floor of a library in 2001 and how it was redeveloped in 2009. S</strong></em></span><em style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>ummarise the information by selecting and reporting the main features, and make comparisons where relevant.</strong></em></div>",
        "order": 1,
        "instruction": "<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\">HƯỚNG DẪN VIẾT B&Agrave;I</h2>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><em>IELTS Writing Task 1 - Library Ground Floor: 2001 vs 2009</em></p>\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-UQlGdpAaUoJFOsxWOYzlDAiUgDe\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>1.</strong><strong> </strong><strong>Giải th&iacute;ch đề</strong></span></h3>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-N0nNdqrxtoU9EGxkGvml6QHzgzd\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-GWPNd7ft0oPRpuxfDGnl1aKWgoe\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-QxWPdDnfdod2NixZJAjlLYzqgGb\">Đề b&agrave;i Library Ground Floor: 2001 vs 2009 y&ecirc;u cầu m&ocirc; tả về sự thay đổi bố cục của tầng trệt một thư viện từ giữa từ năm 2001 đến 2009.</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-QxWPdDnfdod2NixZJAjlLYzqgGb\">&nbsp;</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-TTLqda2f9ooxOTxsgKLlEoHXgHc\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VqlMdCrpLo9ZDwxoVI4lrX3Qgcg\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>2.</strong><strong> Định hướng viết Introduction</strong></span></h3>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-J4uYdJ7WaomtjrxzeNDl41h0g1n\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-DQntd3hjzoNCjwxOfz4lvHOcgbb\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-N9LhdhEVXoJnGNxJPvyl0YZPg9e\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-CRT6dLvfRoVbHtxCnc9l7AdygTl\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\" old-record-id-KGfkdvXnMo9tBVxWubvlf0gagVh\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-TOoQd6oJTo25Hhxi84tlE4FPgnb\"><strong>Nội dung:</strong> Paraphrase đề Library Ground Floor: 2001 vs 2009 với c&aacute;c dữ kiện ch&iacute;nh l&agrave;: bố cục - tầng trệt một thư viện - thay đổi - 2001 v&agrave; 2009.</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-TOoQd6oJTo25Hhxi84tlE4FPgnb\">&nbsp;</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-J4uYdJ7WaomtjrxzeNDl41h0g1n\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VqlMdCrpLo9ZDwxoVI4lrX3Qgcg\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>3.</strong><strong> Định hướng viết Overview</strong></span></h3>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-M2Q9ds2Mgoz0ICx8JzslKUMJgWf\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-WTQ0dwsgtot3Mux4ZXOl05hSgTH\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-AmqcddMWAotWQFxJT6xl8CElghf\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-RKcrd7u17ogCsex6cUPlJ2cCgkh\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-JLrudDKQVoB78vxXmgzldmNBgLh\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-D4hcdPzqjofruexFbEolyCJig4f\">Theo <strong>Logical Framework<sup>&copy;</sup></strong>, với dạng đề map, ch&uacute;ng m&igrave;nh sẽ tập trung n&oacute;i về c&aacute;c sự thay đổi ch&iacute;nh:</div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-JE1Uddqf1oJY07xFlU5lWl9ugXc\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>c&aacute;c kệ s&aacute;ch trong thư viện đ&atilde; được tổ chức lại để đ&aacute;p ứng danh mục s&aacute;ch mở rộng với nhiều thể loại đa dạng hơn</div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VHhadwzAuoEDHvxPnlVlrDrlg9c\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>một khu vực mới d&agrave;nh cho trẻ em, với c&aacute;c s&aacute;ch ph&ugrave; hợp với lứa tuổi, đ&atilde; được th&ecirc;m v&agrave;o để thay thế khu vực s&aacute;ch tiểu thuyết ở cuối thư viện.</div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-JLrudDKQVoB78vxXmgzldmNBgLh\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-JLrudDKQVoB78vxXmgzldmNBgLh\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-M2Q9ds2Mgoz0ICx8JzslKUMJgWf\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VqlMdCrpLo9ZDwxoVI4lrX3Qgcg\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>4.</strong><strong> Ph&acirc;n chia BODY r&otilde; r&agrave;ng</strong></span></h3>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-RIbUdfSlNoloclxlVrOltQUhg8e\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-P98ZdcS4KoF2cIxRdnYl02e4gre\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-FVyzdmf9noY8HEx1DxAl475ZgPh\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-ZRV0dgAnjoXiRVxRxmol5UwwgBb\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-PlnOdHjiuoEse4xeDDrlsghVgug\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">Theo <strong>Logical Framework<sup>&copy;</sup></strong>, ch&uacute;ng m&igrave;nh sẽ chia đoạn th&acirc;n b&agrave;i một c&aacute;ch r&otilde; r&agrave;ng, bằng c&aacute;ch gom c&aacute;c sự thay đổi dựa tr&ecirc;n ti&ecirc;u ch&iacute; <strong>về mặt địa l&yacute;</strong>:</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-PlnOdHjiuoEse4xeDDrlsghVgug\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-PlnOdHjiuoEse4xeDDrlsghVgug\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 164, 51);\"><strong>BODY 1:</strong><strong> Khu vực gần entrance v&agrave; b&ecirc;n phải thư viện</strong></span>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VAAOdMlEiofo79x8ENOlBTjfgDb\">Theo <strong>Logical Framework<sup>&copy;</sup></strong>, ch&uacute;ng m&igrave;nh sẽ định hướng c&aacute;c bạn viết từng bước ở BODY 1 như sau:</div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-EOCidCbWxoqZZWxcVYylbCYagRS\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>(Step 1) Khi bước v&agrave;o thư viện, kh&aacute;ch sẽ đầu ti&ecirc;n nh&igrave;n thấy <strong>b&agrave;n của thủ thư (librarian's desk)</strong> v&agrave; <strong>cầu thang (stairs)</strong> ở b&ecirc;n phải&nbsp;</div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-EOCidCbWxoqZZWxcVYylbCYagRS\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>--&gt; Cả hai đều giữ nguy&ecirc;n v&agrave;o năm 2009, đồng thời c&oacute; th&ecirc;m&nbsp;<strong>2 trạm m&aacute;y t&iacute;nh (computer stations)</strong> được bố tr&iacute; gần cầu thang.</div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-NknWdh9ZOo56HixtUgLlRjKagGf\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>(Step 2) Ph&iacute;a sau b&agrave;n thủ thư, trước đ&acirc;y c&oacute; t&aacute;m <strong>chiếc b&agrave;n (tables)</strong> đặt ở vị tr&iacute; trung t&acirc;m, với <strong>c&aacute;c kệ s&aacute;ch d&agrave;nh cho b&aacute;o v&agrave; tạp ch&iacute; (shelves for newspapers and priodicals)</strong> ở b&ecirc;n phải&nbsp;</div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-NknWdh9ZOo56HixtUgLlRjKagGf\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>--&gt; 8 năm sau, c&aacute;c b&agrave;n nhỏ hơn đ&atilde; được thay thế bằng bốn chiếc b&agrave;n lớn hơn, v&agrave; c&aacute;c kệ s&aacute;ch giờ đ&acirc;y&nbsp;<em>d&agrave;nh cho (be designated for)</em> <strong>phim v&agrave; DVD (films and DVDs) </strong>thay v&igrave; b&aacute;o ch&iacute;.</div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<br><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 164, 51);\"><strong>BODY 2</strong><strong>: Khu vực b&ecirc;n tr&aacute;i v&agrave; tr&ecirc;n c&ugrave;ng</strong></span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-PlnOdHjiuoEse4xeDDrlsghVgug\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-EwzTddSWRoqDSGxM4hFlvPg1grc\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-DvwddScPKofEauxBvTXlhJOngAf\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">Theo <strong>Logical Framework<sup>&copy;</sup></strong>, ch&uacute;ng m&igrave;nh sẽ định hướng c&aacute;c bạn viết từng bước ở BODY 2 như sau:</div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-BoLwdDT5UoFbdBxnmkNlEIgZgFf\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>(Step 1) Trong bố cục ban đầu, chỉ c&oacute; hai khu vực, cụ thể l&agrave; <strong>s&aacute;ch tự lực v&agrave; lịch sử (self-help and history)</strong></div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-BoLwdDT5UoFbdBxnmkNlEIgZgFf\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>--&gt; V&agrave;o năm 2009, tăng l&ecirc;n s&aacute;u khu vực, d&agrave;nh cho lịch sử, tiểu thuyết, tự lực, s&aacute;ch về bếp, kinh tế, v&agrave; cuối c&ugrave;ng l&agrave; một khu vực nhỏ cho s&aacute;ch luật.</div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-PBmTdb27PoxQU7xQWQyltHhqgkh\" style=\"text-align: justify;\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>(Step 2) ở cuối thư viện, c&oacute; một khu vực s&aacute;ch tiểu thuyết <strong>(fiction)</strong></div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-PBmTdb27PoxQU7xQWQyltHhqgkh\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">--&gt; được thay thế bởi một khu vực <strong>s&aacute;ch d&agrave;nh cho trẻ em (children's books)</strong>, v&agrave; một kh&ocirc;ng gian được ở ph&iacute;a trước d&agrave;nh ri&ecirc;ng cho trẻ em đọc s&aacute;ch.</div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>",
        "writing_logical_frame": [
          {
            "id": 1652,
            "sort": 1,
            "name": "Introduction",
            "value": "<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-XsardSANuoS7QOxI3GKlITo8gwe\">The floorplans illustrate the layout of the ground floor of a library in 2001, and the changes that had occurred by 2009.</div>\n</div>",
            "question_id": 18143,
            "is_toggle_on": true
          },
          {
            "id": 1653,
            "sort": 2,
            "name": "Overview",
            "value": "<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-PCJcdjZW7ocJsLxYhPBlkdPSgkg\">Overall, the library's bookshelves were reorganized to accommodate the expanded catalogue with a broader range of genres, while a new area for children, with age-appropriate books, was built to replace the fiction section at the far end of the library.</div>\n</div>",
            "question_id": 18143,
            "is_toggle_on": true
          },
          {
            "id": 1654,
            "sort": 3,
            "name": "Body 1",
            "value": "<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-R3tGdeF04oWsfdx5vqcl9TNEgUb\">Upon entering the library, in 2001, visitors first saw a librarian's desk and the stairs to its right, both of which had remained unchanged in terms of location and design, while two computer stations had been set up near the stairs by 2009. Beyond the librarian's desk, there used to be eight centrally located tables, with shelves for newspapers and periodicals to the right. After 8 years, the smaller tables had been replaced by four larger ones, and the shelves had been designated for films and DVDs instead.</div>\n</div>",
            "question_id": 18143,
            "is_toggle_on": true
          },
          {
            "id": 1655,
            "sort": 4,
            "name": "Body 2",
            "value": "<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-NoEldTeQdobRt9xDkU8l6vowgec\">The left-hand side of the library was lined with bookcases throughout in both years. In the original layout, there were just two sections, namely self-help and history, and in 2009, there were six, for history, fiction, self-help, kitchen, economics, and finally a small section for law. In 2009, at the far end of the library, replacing the fiction section, there was a children's book section, and a designated space in front for children to read them.</div>\n</div>",
            "question_id": 18143,
            "is_toggle_on": true
          }
        ],
